# Clause 8: Operation

## Overview
Clause 8 addresses the operational aspects of information security, including risk assessment processes and risk treatment implementation.

## Gaps in this Clause

| Gap | Title | Risk | Status |
|-----|-------|------|--------|
| GAP-011 | Operational Planning | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-012 | Periodic Risk Assessment | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-013 | Risk Treatment | HIGH | Not Implemented |

## Key Requirements

- Develop operational security processes
- Conduct periodic risk assessments
- Implement risk treatment plans
- Select and implement appropriate controls
- Monitor operational effectiveness

## Remediation Priority

**CRITICAL** — These gaps address how risks are actually treated. Without implementation, identified risks remain uncontrolled.
